<div class="govuk-grid-row">
    <div class="govuk-grid-column-two-thirds">
        <span class="govuk-caption-l">Add a heat network</span>
        <h1 class="govuk-heading-l">
            Heat network summary
        </h1>
        <p class="govuk-body">You're registering a communal heat network supplied by a separate upstream network</p>
        <p class="govuk-body">The main energy centre should be registered as a separate district network by that organisation.</p>
        <div class="app-button-wrapper">
            <a asp-controller="HeatNetworkRegistration" asp-action="HeatNetworkSummary" asp-method="GET" role="button" data-module="govuk-button" draggable="false" class="govuk-button">Continue</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>